---
// The Workshop · one Sources toggle for every chapter (Atelier campaign, STAR-98; the
// integration's round 2, item 5). The summary of each chapter's quiet Sources note, in the
// Rig's pattern: named exactly "Sources", its +/– mark hidden from the accessibility tree.
// Each page keeps its own <details> and its own list; this is only the summary.
---
<summary class="ws-sources-sum"><span class="ws-sources-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Sources</summary>

<style>
  .ws-sources-sum {
    display: inline-block; min-height: 24px; padding: 0.3em 0; cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink-soft);
    font: 600 0.86rem/1.3 ui-sans-serif, "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: none;
  }
  .ws-sources-sum::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .ws-sources-sum:hover { color: var(--amber-soft); }
  .ws-sources-sum:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .ws-sources-mark::before { content: "+ "; color: var(--faint); }
  :global(details[open]) > .ws-sources-sum .ws-sources-mark::before { content: "– "; }
</style>
